# src/shared/

Cross-cutting infrastructure shared across all modules.

- `config/` — app configuration (env loading)
- `errors/` — custom `AppError` base class and `GlobalErrorFilter`
- `database/` — ORM modules (Prisma, TypeORM, Mongoose)
- `cache/` — Redis module and service
- `messaging/` — Kafka/RabbitMQ client modules
- `auth/` — JWT auth module, guards, strategy, decorators
- `health/` — health check controller and ORM/Redis indicators
